{
  "name": "SplitPane",
  "group": "layout",
  "description": "Paneles divididos con divisores arrastrables y manejables con teclado.",
  "import": "import { SplitPane, Pane } from \"@zuccadev-labs/zuix-zout\"",
  "exports": ["SplitPane", "Pane"],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "direction",
      "type": "enum",
      "values": ["row", "column"],
      "default": "row"
    },
    {
      "name": "sizes",
      "type": "number[]",
      "description": "Fracciones controladas; suman 1."
    },
    {
      "name": "defaultSizes",
      "type": "number[]"
    },
    {
      "name": "onSizesChange",
      "type": "(sizes: number[]) => void"
    },
    {
      "name": "minFraction",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0.1
    },
    {
      "name": "Pane.header",
      "type": "ReactNode"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pane.focused",
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "true marca el panel con borde de acento; false lo atenúa."
    },
    {
      "name": "dividerLabel",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "Resize panes",
      "description": "Nombre accesible de cada divisor."
    }
  ],
  "tokens": [
    "accent",
    "accent-ring",
    "line",
    "reading-bg",
    "surface",
    "scrim",
    "layer-raised",
    "control-height-md",
    "duration-fast",
    "ease-standard",
    "fg-muted",
    "radius-lg",
    "radius-xs",
    "space-1",
    "space-2",
    "space-3",
    "text-small",
    "touch-target",
    "weight-medium"
  ],
  "classes": ["z-split", "z-pane"],
  "a11y": "Patrón «window splitter» de WAI-ARIA: cada divisor es role=separator enfocable con aria-orientation, aria-controls (el panel que tiene delante) y aria-valuenow, aria-valuemin y aria-valuemax en porcentaje. Las flechas lo mueven un 2 % hacia donde apuntan (también en RTL); Inicio y Fin lo llevan a su mínimo y a su máximo. Doble clic reparte a partes iguales los dos paneles del divisor: es la alternativa de un solo gesto al arrastre (WCAG 2.5.7). Con puntero grueso la zona de agarre crece hasta `--z-touch-target`.",
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Editor y vista previa",
      "code": "<SplitPane defaultSizes={[0.6, 0.4]}>\n  <Pane header=\"Editor\" focused>…</Pane>\n  <Pane header=\"Preview\" focused={false}>…</Pane>\n</SplitPane>"
    }
  ],
  "behavior": "dom",
  "html": [
    {
      "title": "Editor, vista previa y salida",
      "code": "<div style=\"width:100%;height:240px\">\n  <div class=\"z-split\" id=\"split-demo\" data-direction=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"z-split__pane\" style=\"flex-grow:0.6\">\n      <div class=\"z-split\" data-direction=\"column\">\n        <div class=\"z-split__pane\" style=\"flex-grow:0.65\">\n          <div class=\"z-pane\" data-focused=\"true\">\n            <div class=\"z-pane__header\">Editor</div>\n            <div class=\"z-pane__body\">\n              <div style=\"padding:var(--z-space-2)\">export const answer = 42;</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" aria-label=\"Resize output\" aria-valuenow=\"65\" aria-valuemin=\"10\" aria-valuemax=\"90\" class=\"z-split__divider\"></div>\n        <div class=\"z-split__pane\" style=\"flex-grow:0.35\">\n          <div class=\"z-pane\" data-focused=\"false\">\n            <div class=\"z-pane__header\">Output</div>\n            <div class=\"z-pane__body\">\n              <div style=\"padding:var(--z-space-2)\">ready in 312 ms</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" aria-label=\"Resize panes\" aria-valuenow=\"60\" aria-valuemin=\"10\" aria-valuemax=\"90\" class=\"z-split__divider\"></div>\n    <div class=\"z-split__pane\" style=\"flex-grow:0.4\">\n      <div class=\"z-pane\" data-focused=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"z-pane__header\">Preview</div>\n        <div class=\"z-pane__body\">\n              <div style=\"padding:var(--z-space-2)\">42</div>\n            </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "origin": "`split` y `pane` de zutool."
}
